        "text": "Diagnosed where it struggled with a three-tier, ~65-test evaluation harness (tool-level \u2192 API \u2192 live) and hallucination-rate analysis, debugging failures layer by layer, and used the same harness to validate the Groq to Bedrock migration after a rate-limit evaluation."
